  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MR dagarna 2022</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MR days 2022 - MR dagarna 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MR-dagarna 2022
Sida har under m&#xe5;nga &#xe5;r deltagit p&#xe5; M&#xe4;nskliga R&#xe4;ttighetsdagarna, MR-dagarna, Nordens st&#xf6;rsta m&#xe4;ssa 
f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter. &#xc4;ven i &#xe5;r finns planer p&#xe5; att delta med ett seminarium.
MR-dagarna har funnits sedan &#xe5;r 2000 och &#xe4;r Nordens st&#xf6;rsta samlade m&#xf6;tesplats f&#xf6;r praktiker, forskare, 
myndigheter, politiker och ideellt engagerade som arbetar med eller vill l&#xe4;ra mer om m&#xe4;nskliga 
r&#xe4;ttigheter. Syftet med arrangemanget &#xe4;r bland annat att &#xf6;ka kunskapen om m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The MR days 2022
For many years, Sida has participated in the Human Rights Days, the MR Days, the largest fair in the Nordics
for human rights. Also this year there are plans to participate with a seminar.
MR days have existed since 2000 and are the Nordic region&apos;s largest gathering place for practitioners, researchers,
authorities, politicians and non-profits who work with or want to learn more about human
rights. The purpose of the arrangement is, among other things, to increase knowledge about human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
